{"translation":{"id":"pan_irv","name":"ਇੰਡਿਅਨ ਰਿਵਾਇਜ਼ਡ ਵਰਜ਼ਨ (IRV) - ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Punjabi Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"pan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"7bcf70d369a169a12ac867ce44def25b36147b72029339f8c8d3c7a06bab588d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31104,"languageName":"ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","languageEnglishName":"Punjabi"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"pan_irv","name":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","commonName":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","title":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"8a1b7c5c3025a80671b87659256d14a42fb58ace987b687a83db2b26ac8a5d95","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":121,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ਪਰਮੇਸ਼ੁਰ ਸਾਡੀ ਰੱਖਿਆ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲਾ"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ਯਾਤਰਾ ਦਾ ਗੀਤ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ਮੈਂ ਆਪਣੀਆਂ ਅੱਖਾਂ ਪਹਾੜਾਂ ਵੱਲ ਚੁੱਕਾਂਗਾ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਮੇਰੀ ਸਹਾਇਤਾ ਕਿੱਥੋਂ ਆਵੇਗੀ?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਮੇਰੀ ਸਹਾਇਤਾ ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਵੱਲੋਂ ਹੈ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਜੋ ਅਕਾਸ਼ ਤੇ ਧਰਤੀ ਦਾ ਕਰਤਾ ਹੈ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਉਹ ਤੇਰੇ ਪੈਰ ਨੂੰ ਡੋਲਣ ਨਾ ਦੇਵੇਗਾ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਤੇਰਾ ਰਾਖ਼ਾ ਨਾ ਉਂਘਲਾਵੇਗਾ,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਵੇਖ, ਇਸਰਾਏਲ ਦਾ ਰਾਖ਼ਾ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਨਾ ਉਂਘਲਾਵੇਗਾ ਨਾ ਸੌਵੇਂਗਾ!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਤੇਰਾ ਰਾਖ਼ਾ ਹੈ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਤੇਰੇ ਸੱਜੇ ਹੱਥ ਤੇ ਤੇਰਾ ਸਾਯਾ ਹੈ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਨਾ ਦਿਨੇ ਸੂਰਜ ਤੈਨੂੰ ਮਾਰੇਗਾ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਨਾ ਰਾਤੀਂ ਚੰਦਰਮਾ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਸਾਰੀ ਬਦੀ ਤੋਂ ਤੇਰੀ ਰੱਖਿਆ ਕਰੇਗਾ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਉਹ ਤੇਰੀ ਜਾਨ ਦੀ ਰਾਖੀ ਕਰੇਗਾ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਤੇਰੇ ਅੰਦਰ-ਬਾਹਰ ਆਉਣ ਜਾਣ ਵਿੱਚ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਹੁਣ ਤੋਂ ਲੈ ਕੇ ਸਦੀਪਕ ਕਾਲ ਤੱਕ ਰੱਖਿਆ ਕਰੇਗਾ!","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/121.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/122.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/120.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}